
https://github.com/kaksmet/jpeg-decoder/

JPEG: the decoder (src/io/jpg) gives libjpeg-turbo's pixels, so its inverse DCT, upsampling,
colour conversion, block smoothing and handling of damaged data follow libjpeg-turbo's
arithmetic. This software is based in part on the work of the Independent JPEG Group.
https://libjpeg-turbo.org/
